message: "If you use this software in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "PyKeithley_DMM6500: Python control of the Keithley DMM6500 multimeter"
abstract: >-
  A Python library for controlling the Keithley DMM6500 6.5-digit digital
  multimeter over Ethernet using TSP commands on a raw TCP socket — no VISA
  or vendor drivers required. Covers DC/AC voltage and current, 2- and
  4-wire resistance, temperature, filters, NPLC, and trigger control, with
  Van der Pauw sheet-resistance measurement utilities and a command-line
  interface.
type: software
